                "description": "The Craftsman Full Length Mortise Handleset is an old classic that speaks of the craftmanship that used to go into every piece of door hardware. The Craftsman Full Length Handleset is available in 4 authentic finishes and comes with your choice of interior knob or lever. This beautiful mortise front door lockset is available as a single cylinder handleset or a dummy function which is great for adding a matching set to the inactive side of a set of double doors. The Craftsman Full Length Mortise Entrance Handleset comes in many stunning finishes.",
